    \code{threshold_const}. The \eqn{\sigma_i / s_j} factor makes the cutoff
    dimensionally coherent, so it is not distorted when series are measured
    in different units.
  \item \code{"soft"}: \eqn{\tau = 1 / (p n \log(T - p))}.
  \item \code{"hard"}: \eqn{\tau = n^{-0.49}}.
